    <description><![CDATA[AI ColourBack brings old black-and-white photos to life with DDColor neural networks. Runs 100% locally on your PC hardware without cloud uploads, per-photo fees, or privacy risk. Features multiple historic colour palettes and noise reduction.

Licensing: AI ColourBack is commercial software and requires a paid license key (£14.99 one-time purchase, 12 months of updates included, online activation required; no free trial and no recurring subscription). Purchase at https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=colourback.]]></description>
